# Pairs with NoKeyLost. A plain write accepted on the old copy during a resize
# lands only locally and is not mirrored to the resized copy, so the flip loses
# it.
MODULE: NoKeyLostLaterWriteNotMirrored
TARGET: NoKeyLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a write during a resize is not mirrored, so the flip loses it
PERTURBS: LaterWrite

--- FIND
                        IF k = k2 /\ <<x, y>> \in Landing(c, s, k2)
                        THEN Max(row[x][y][k], LaterV) ELSE row[x][y][k]]]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the write lands only where it was routed.
                        IF k = k2 /\ <<x, y>> = <<c, s>>
                        THEN Max(row[x][y][k], LaterV) ELSE row[x][y][k]]]]
--- END